 "boundaryRule": "Order: the rest of Spell 125 first (owner, 2026-11-16), then the papyrus from Plate I to Plate XXXVII. Page ranges are a first pass from Budge's running heads; each establishing firing fixes the real start and end on the page and records them (start/end in the established file). A part marked 'after' starts where that part's established file ends. Budge's Appendix sections and footnote texts (supplied from other papyri) are never part of the text. Already published and not repeated: the Confession, pp. 198–203 (ani-spell125-opening). One supplement (owner, 2026-11-16): ani-125-address, the address to the gods that other papyri have after the Confession, taken from Budge's Appendix (pp. 203–212) and marked for the reader as not on Ani's papyrus. No other Appendix is published.",
